<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70555" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεφρ-ίτης</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, ὁ,  fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεφρῖτις</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεφριαῖος, σφόνδυλος</span>
			, i.e. the first vertebra of the sacrum, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.179
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσον νεφρῖτιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθίσις ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Int.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			: also as Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεφρῖτις</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσος</span>), ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				502
			</span></i>: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.14
			</span></i>.</div>
